<BaseLayout title="Ordering terms" description="Whole-package enquiries, quote acceptance, payment and collection terms."><div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><h1>Ordering terms</h1><p>Every online purchase starts with an enquiry, not an automatic checkout.</p></header><article class="prose section"><h2>Whole bags only</h2><p>Choose a positive whole number of bags or large packages. Loose quantities are not supported. Reference prices and availability are informational; your quote confirms the precise package, price, quantity and transport charge. Illustrative catalog entries are examples, never offers or actual stock.</p><h2>Quotes and reservations</h2><p>Quotes are valid for 48 hours. Accept the current quote before expiry. Acceptance rechecks stock and reserves the quoted packages together. Each quote states any required deposit and reservation deadline. Unpaid expired holds may be released. Changed items require a revised quote; no silent substitutions.</p><h2>Payment and credit</h2><p>Cash and manually verified UPI are supported. A reference or screenshot is evidence only until staff confirms actual receipt. Credit requires staff approval for each sale. Advances and dues are entries in the shop ledger, not transferable stored money. Sales bills and receipts are provided; the app does not calculate GST or issue GST invoices and makes no claim of legal tax exemption.</p><h2>Collection and transport</h2><p>Choose pickup, your own driver, or shop-arranged tempo/e-rickshaw. Confirm transport charges and the assigned cash collector in the quote. Driver assignment does not confirm receipt or remittance of money.</p><h2>Cancellations, returns and refunds</h2><p>Request cancellation before dispatch. Staff must review returns, quantities and any refund. Records of completed payments and corrections remain auditable. Contact the shop for the applicable return arrangements before accepting a quote; this preview does not invent a return window.</p><h2>Connection required</h2><p>Offline browsing or saving a bag list does not send an enquiry, reserve stock or record a payment. Look for server confirmation after reconnecting.</p><p><a href="/contact/">Contact the shop</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy information</a></p></article></div></BaseLayout>
